Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.96,0:00:46.20,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I been in my own lane, movin’ silent
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.20,0:00:47.98,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}People look but they don’t really find it
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.98,0:00:49.58,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}All this pain but I keep it quiet
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.58,0:00:51.30,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Smile on but my mind get violent
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.30,0:00:52.74,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I don’t really trust what they say now
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.74,0:00:54.40,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Everybody fake when they play round
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.40,0:00:56.08,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I just stack up, I don’t stay down
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.08,0:00:57.80,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I been up even when I break down
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.80,0:00:59.68,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}You don’t hit me like you used to
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.90,0:01:01.36,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Now I feel like I’m misused too
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.36,0:01:03.06,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Same energy I gave you
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.22,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Now I don’t even know you
