Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.40,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I been workin’ while they talk loud
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.88,0:01:41.16,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I been grindin’ while they watch crowds
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.16,0:01:42.72,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Now I’m somewhere they don’t know how
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.72,0:01:44.44,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}To reach me when I’m up now
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.44,0:01:46.40,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I remember when they ignored me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.44,0:01:48.08,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Now they act like they support me
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.64,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}That shit don’t really mean nothin’
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.44,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I been did it without lovin’
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.12,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}I just keep it movin’ forward
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.12,0:01:54.78,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}Ain’t no time for going backwards
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.94,0:01:56.32,Lyric,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(960,540)\fad(160,220)}If you didn’t see me then
